      Q. 1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَرْفَجَهُ</span></b> , (L, K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَرْفَجَةٌ</span>, (TA,)
<i>He took it plentifully,</i> or <i>largely.</i> (L, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<i>He made it to be of the best kind;</i> namely, food,
or meat and drink. (Er-Riyáshee.)

